<Slide notes={`接下来要看的是，怎么把请求、移动和确认这三件事连成一条能取证的线。

一条闭环要成立，每一环都得留下证据：谁提交了请求、谁给出了建议、人有没有真的移动、窗口有没有真的回复、最后有没有真的确认。

缺任何一环，这条闭环就不算成立。停在入口建议上，或者只是走到了窗口，都不够。

所以这一块的重点不是最后结论好不好看，而是每一环有没有真实发生、能不能被取到。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 640, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 22 }}>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#276FBF' }}>3　　4.1.4 — 4.1.5</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>用条件连接请求、移动与确认</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 4, background: '#276FBF' }} />

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7, width: 900 }}>每一环都要能取到证据；缺一环，闭环就不成立，比率也要按真实分母重算。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 220, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#276FBF' }}>提交首句</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 220, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#276FBF' }}>实际移动</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 220, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#276FBF' }}>窗口回复</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 220, height: 64, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#26816B' }}>真实确认</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>4.1 社区服务大厅</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>13 / 24</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
